{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49627","headline":"临江仙 二 · 李珣","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莺报帘前暖日红，玉炉残麝犹浓。\n起来闺思尚疎慵，[别]愁春梦，谁解此情悰。\n强整娇姿临宝镜，小池一朵芙蓉。\n旧欢无处再寻踪，更堪回顾，屏画九疑峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}